        "heading": "<h2>Skincare that works in sync with LED light</h2>",
        "text": "<p>LED therapy works by delivering light energy into the skin. But what you apply before your session matters.</p><p>Many serums are designed for overnight repair or active treatment — not for repeated light exposure. Some can interfere with LED light therapy, be irritating, or simply weren't formulated with LED in mind.</p><p>Blue+ is different.</p><p>It uses methylene blue, an antioxidant studied in light-exposure contexts, in a lightweight formula designed to sit comfortably on skin during LED sessions.</p>",
        "button_label": "Shop Now",
        "button_url": "#",
        "wistia_url": "qk92k5wrnj"
      }
